      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, i definitely take eliquis. i checked my bottle. and i dont feel that bad, its just a dull ache. i really dont want to sit in an ER for 6 hours if it's just a minor bump. if i don't have any dizziness or vomiting right now, isn't it probably fine to just wait and see how i feel in the morning?",
